<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (It is such a joy to share with you our 2025 Impact Report. This past year, my first as CEO, has been one of the most humbling and inspiring chapters of my life. I have witnessed firsthand the strength of survivors, the dedication of our team, and the unwavering support of this community. In these pages you will see how your support provided safety, counseling, housing resources, and community for survivors this year. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
