/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As you read this report, I hope you see not only the measurable outcomes but also the sacredness of this work. REST was founded on the belief that healing happens in relationships, and that hope is not just possible...it is powerful!)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Behind every number in this report is a survivor like a mother rebuilding her life, a teen finding safety, or a neighbor stepping into freedom for the first time. I am especially grateful for the courageous survivors who share their wisdom with us and help shape the future of REST.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
